\title{awscrt: Hardware-Accelerated CRC Checksums from the AWS Common Runtime}
\description{
Computes CRC32, CRC32C and CRC64NVME checksums using the 'aws-checksums' library from the AWS Common Runtime ('CRT'), with runtime dispatch to hardware instructions (SSE4.2, PCLMULQDQ, AVX-512, ARMv8 CRC and PMULL) and a portable software fallback. Results are returned as big-endian raw vectors, matching the bytes the 'S3' flexible-checksum headers are built from, and can be chained for incremental hashing.
